@startuml
!include ./nora-medlink-style.puml
title Figure 3.10 — Nora MedLink Activity Diagram: Report Upload and OCR

start
:Patient selects report file;
:Patient enters title and department;
:Frontend submits multipart form data;
:Backend verifies patient session;
if (File type and size valid?) then (Yes)
  :Store file under patient upload path;
  :Create pending PatientReport object;
  :Send file to OCR.Space;
  if (OCR text extracted?) then (Yes)
    :Clean OCR text;
    :Detect department and keywords;
    :Extract structured report fields;
    :Run AI entity, rule and summary pipeline;
    :Set report status to COMPLETED;
    :Save PatientReport and MedicalAiAnalysis;
    :Return completed report to frontend;
  else (No)
    :Set report status to FAILED;
    :Save report with OCR error summary;
    :Return failure state for manual review;
  endif
else (No)
  :Reject upload request;
  :Return validation error;
endif
:Patient reviews report result;
stop
@enduml
